# Пользователи
## Создать нового пользователя

POST http://localhost:4000/users/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jacktorrance@overlook.net",
  "avatarPath": "torrance.png",
  "name": "Jack Torrance",
  "password": "shining",
  "isPro": false
}

###

POST http://localhost:4000/users/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jacktorrent@overlook.net",
  "avatarPath": "torrent.png",
  "name": "Jack Torrent",
  "password": "doctor",
  "isPro": false
}

###

## Авторизовать пользователя

POST http://localhost:4000/users/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jacktorrent@overlook.net",
  "password": "doctor"
}

###

## Проверить состояние авторизации

GET http://localhost:4000/users/login HTTP/1.1

###

POST http://localhost:4000/users/logout HTTP/1.1

###

POST http://localhost:4000/users/1/avatar HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

{
  "avatar": "avatar.png"
}

###
